The Lordaeron landscape is dotted by Scout Towers that once served as both an early warning system for trouble and a projection of the safety and security the Kingdom offered its people.  Now they are occupied by the Scarlet Crusade and used to gather information on the burgeoning Forsaken society. The information these towers could provide would prove very useful.
